---
import { clusters } from '../data/clusters';
import MainBackrefBox from './MainBackrefBox.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="brand-col">
        <div class="brand">
          <span>머니룩</span>
          <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="tagline">한국 직장인·청년을 위한 생활금융 종합 가이드</p>
        <p class="disclaimer">
          본 사이트의 정책·요율·법령 정보는 변경될 수 있습니다.
          신청 직전 <a href="https://www.gov.kr" rel="noopener" target="_blank">정부24</a>·
          <a href="https://www.hometax.go.kr" rel="noopener" target="_blank">홈택스</a>·
          <a href="https://www.bokjiro.go.kr" rel="noopener" target="_blank">복지로</a>
          공식 출처에서 재확인하세요.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>카테고리</h2>
        <ul class="links">
          {clusters.slice(0, 6).map((c) => <li><a href={`/${c.slug}/`}>{c.shortTitle}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>&nbsp;</h2>
        <ul class="links">
          {clusters.slice(6).map((c) => <li><a href={`/${c.slug}/`}>{c.shortTitle}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>운영 정보</h2>
        <ul class="links">
          <li><a href="/clusters">전체 글 보기</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">머니룩 소개</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-policy">편집 정책</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms">이용약관</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">문의·제휴</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>구독·피드</h2>
        <ul class="links">
          <li><a href="/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml">전체 RSS</a></li>
          <li><a href="/atom.xml" type="application/atom+xml">Atom</a></li>
          <li><a href="/feed.json" type="application/feed+json">JSON Feed</a></li>
          <li><a href="/llms.txt" type="text/plain">llms.txt (AI)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/feeds/">카테고리별 피드 12종</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="network">
      <h2>네트워크</h2>
      <MainBackrefBox variant="footer" />
    </div>
    <div class="biz-info">
      <strong>사업자 정보</strong>
      <ul>
        <li>상호: 스마트데이터샵 <span class="sep">·</span> 서비스명: 머니룩 (MoneyLook)</li>
        <li>대표: 김준혁</li>
        <li>사업자등록번호: 406-06-34485</li>
        <li>주소: 인천광역시 계양구 새벌로 88</li>
        <li>이메일: <a href="mailto:smartdatashop@gmail.com">smartdatashop@gmail.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <small>© {year} 머니룩 (MoneyLook). All rights reserved.</small>
      <small>광고: 본 사이트는 Google AdSense를 통해 광고 수익을 받으며, 본문과 명확히 구분됩니다.</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.site-footer {
  background: var(--color-footer-bg);
  color: var(--color-footer-fg);
  padding-block: 3rem 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 4rem;
}
.site-footer .container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  padding-inline: 1rem;
  margin-inline: auto;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 2rem;
}
.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--color-footer-strong);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
}
.dot {
  width: 8px; height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--color-primary);
}
.tagline { margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem; color: var(--color-footer-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.disclaimer { font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-footer-muted); max-width: 36rem; }
.disclaimer a { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline; }

.site-footer h2 {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-footer-strong);
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.links {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.links a {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-footer-fg);
}
.links a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }

.network {
  margin-top: 2rem;
  padding-top: 1.25rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-footer-border);
}
.network h2 {
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.biz-info {
  margin-top: 2rem;
  padding-top: 1.25rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-footer-border);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--color-footer-muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
}
.biz-info strong {
  display: block;
  color: var(--color-footer-strong);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 0.74rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.biz-info ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
}
.biz-info .sep { color: var(--color-footer-muted); margin: 0 0.25rem; opacity: 0.5; }
.biz-info a { color: var(--color-primary); }
.biz-info a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

.bottom {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
  padding-top: 1rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-footer-border);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--color-footer-muted);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
}
</style>
